            "elType": "widget",
            "settings": {
              "title": "The goal of this project was to design and implement a digital solution that bridges the gap between underserved borrowers and accessible home financing. The platform had to support alternative lending workflows, offer strong data security, and ensure a seamless experience for both applicants and internal loan processors. Key project milestones included:<br><br>• Market & Borrower Persona Research<br>• Financial Product Modeling for Non-traditional Applicants<br>• Secure Loan Application & Processing Portal<br>• ITIN and Alternative ID Integration<br>• Credit Flexibility Tools & Pre-qualification Automation<br>• Cloud-Based Infrastructure Deployment<br>• End-to-End Lending Workflow System<br>• Compliance & Risk Management Module<br>• Post-launch Training and Customer Support Tools",
